Z||000008||rogergarrison||07-31-2001||01:59 PM||||I had a 66 camper (i think anyway) I actually lived out of it for a year except for showers at gfs. I think you meant the gasoline heater. Mine had it. I painted it custom, had the interior all redone custom. During cruise nites, everyone hung out in it cause it stayed toasty without running. I think it burned about 1/2 gal of gas in a nite. Bed was comfy too, took it to out of state Van Cruises, and took 2 girls, (that was nice n cozy) Im sure youll have fun with it too. beware of lugging engine on long grades, my dad blew one engine and I blew 2, always the same connecting rod thru the block.||||reg||1
