Z||000010||BC-GT||07-31-2001||02:29 PM||||Me and 3 friends bought this one when we were all 16 in high school. We had a dream of going to BC to pick magic mushrooms in it. Very cool vans, about as reliable as my current Fiero though. Typical response from the local VW parts warehouse at the time was "that will be 6 weeks from Germany for that part"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.imagestation.com/picture/p118fd9e7e5f9d0e82ba29cf62955874a/fe521986.jpg.orig.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.imagestation.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
